This software downloads and uses the following third-party data at runtime. None of it is
included in this repository.

- adsb.fi Open Data API (https://adsb.fi). Personal, non-commercial use; attribution required.
- adsb.lol API (https://adsb.lol). Data licensed under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.
- tar1090-db by wiedehopf (https://github.com/wiedehopf/tar1090-db), derived from the
  Mictronics readsb database. Used for aircraft type/registration and military address ranges.
- plane-alert-db by SDR-Enthusiasts, Ramon F. Kolb (kx1t) and contributors
  (https://github.com/sdr-enthusiasts/plane-alert-db). Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0;
  individual contents under the Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0.
- VRS standing data by Virtual Radar Server (https://github.com/vradarserver/standing-data). CC0.
- adsb.im route API (https://adsb.im).
- OurAirports (https://ourairports.com/data/). Public domain.
- Map tiles (c) OpenStreetMap contributors (https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright).
- USGS Elevation Point Query Service (https://epqs.nationalmap.gov). Public domain.
